cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use GeneTrek, please cite it as below. If you use the high-confidence
  NDD gene list (hc_ndd_v7) or its autism, IDD or epilepsy lists, please also
  cite Korkmaz et al. 2026; and cite the source of every column you rely on
  (see DATA_LICENCES.md and https://genetrek.pasteur.fr/cite).
type: software
title: GeneTrek
version: 2.0.0
license: MIT
url: https://genetrek.pasteur.fr
repository-code: https://github.com/bourgeron-lab/genetrek
abstract: >-
  GeneTrek brings together curated gene lists for neurodevelopmental disorders
  and per-gene annotations (constraint, expression, rare-variant results) in one
  versioned table, to search, compare against an explicit background, and
  download.
keywords:
  - neurodevelopmental disorders
  - autism
  - epilepsy
  - intellectual disability
  - gene lists
  - genomics
authors:
  # Placeholder until the creators' names, affiliations and ORCIDs are set.
  - name: Human Genetics and Cognitive Functions, Institut Pasteur
    email: ghfcgenetics@pasteur.fr
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    Operative list of genes associated with autism and neurodevelopmental
    disorders based on database review
  authors:
    - family-names: Leblond
      given-names: Claire S.
    - family-names: Le
      given-names: T. L.
    - family-names: Malesys
      given-names: S.
    - family-names: Cliquet
      given-names: Freddy
    - family-names: Tabet
      given-names: A. C.
    - family-names: Delorme
      given-names: Richard
    - family-names: Rolland
      given-names: Thomas
    - family-names: Bourgeron
      given-names: Thomas
  journal: Molecular and Cellular Neurosciences
  volume: 113
  start: 103623
  year: 2021
  doi: 10.1016/j.mcn.2021.103623
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      The genetic orchestra of autism and its intersections with epilepsy,
      intellectual disability, and ADHD
    authors:
      - family-names: Korkmaz
        given-names: Sélin
      - name: et al.
    journal: Biological Psychiatry
    year: 2026
    doi: 10.1016/j.biopsych.2026.10.003
  - type: data
    title: GeneTrek database, HC-NDD v7 (GeneTrek 2.0.0)
    authors:
      - name: Human Genetics and Cognitive Functions, Institut Pasteur
    publisher:
      name: Zenodo
